// The project's OWN entry point. `maxon test` compiles with `__maxon_test_main` as the entry
// instead, so this becomes unreachable and dead-function elimination drops it — which is the point:
// a project does not have to be rearranged to be testable.
//
// `maxon build maxon-sharp/DebugSamples/testsample` still produces a normal program from it.

function main() returns ExitCode
	print("the project's own main ran\n")

	return 0
end 'main'
